 back as `cursor`. The Reading values guide shows each\ncase with an example.\n","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/entity"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/name"},{"name":"provider","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Required even when the quantity has one provider. Missing or unknown → 400 listing the providers."},{"name":"start","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"description":"Inclusive valid-time bound. The window [start, end] may hold at most 100000 points at the series' resolution; for a series without a known resolution it may span at most 366 days. A larger window is 400 (`param: end`): narrow it."},{"name":"end","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"description":"Inclusive valid-time bound. Same window cap as `start`: at most 100000 points at the series' resolution, or 366 days without a known resolution; larger is 400. Bulk snapshots stop at now even when `end` is later; each snapshot still holds the rows forecast past now."},{"name":"as_of","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Omitted → flat, latest version of every value. An RFC 3339 instant → flat, every value as known at that instant.\n`rolling` → bulk, one snapshot per native step of the series. An ISO 8601 duration (PT1H, PT6H, P1D) → bulk, one snapshot per period anchored on `start`.\nA snapshot is the whole window as known at its instant. Snapshots at which nothing is known are omitted. An as_of in the future is 400.\n"},{"name":"at","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^\\d{2}:\\d{2}$"},"description":"Anchor for a period `as_of`, UTC wall-clock time."},{"name":"max_snapshots","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","default":100,"maximum":1000},"description":"Bulk page size."},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Opaque, from `next`."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValuesFlat"},{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValuesBulk"}]},"examples":{"latest":{"value":{"entity":"SE-SE3","name":"consumption.realised_load.total_load","provider":"entsoe","unit":"MW","resolution":"PT15M","publication_time":"measured","as_of":"latest","points":[{"valid_time":"2026-10-09T06:30:00Z","value":10100,"knowledge_time":"2026-10-09T08:02:59Z","annotation":null},{"valid_time":"2026-10-09T06:45:00Z","value":10100,"knowledge_time":"2026-10-09T08:02:59Z","annotation":"a03_forward_fill"},{"valid_time":"2026-10-09T07:00:00Z","value":10474,"knowledge_time":"2026-10-09T08:02:59Z","annotation":null}]}},"bulk":{"value":{"entity":"SE-SE3","name":"consumption.realised_load.total_load","provider":"entsoe","unit":"MW","resolution":"PT15M","publication_time":"measured","as_of":"PT6H","snapshots":[{"as_of":"2026-10-01T06:00:00Z","points":[{"valid_time":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","value":"…","knowledge_time":"…","annotation":null},{"valid_time":"…","value":"… one point per quarter hour up to the last one known at 06:00, about 04:45 given the hour of latency"}]},{"as_of":"2026-10-01T12:00:00Z","points":["… the window as known at 12:00: the same quarter hours as above, some with a newer version, plus the ones published since"]},{"as_of":"…","points":["… 28 snapshots in total, oldest first"]}],"next":null}}}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unavailable"}}}},"/entities/{entity}/plants":{"get":{"tags":["Discover"],"summary":"Plants in an entity","description":"The plants inside the entity, paged with `cursor` because a price zone can hold several hundred. Not implemented in this iteration: plants hold no timeseries yet.","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/entity"},{"name":"tech